WEBVTT

00:00.420 --> 00:01.550
Green smoothies...

00:01.550 --> 00:02.770
- Excuse me.
- Banana juice.

00:03.250 --> 00:06.180
- One strawberry shake.
- Strawberry shake...

00:06.180 --> 00:07.070
- And...
- I've decided!

00:07.580 --> 00:10.530
Melon soda with special coconut ice cream.

00:10.530 --> 00:13.910
Topped with cream and elderflower syrup.

00:14.830 --> 00:15.750
Huh?

00:16.850 --> 00:17.540
Huh?

00:19.310 --> 00:20.110
Oh...

00:22.380 --> 00:23.880
Alice?! Why are you here?!

00:23.880 --> 00:27.010
You... Why are you here too?!

00:46.230 --> 00:52.620
OUR LAST CRUSADE OR THE RISE
OF A NEW WORLD SEASON 2

01:57.460 --> 01:59.640
EPISODE 2: WITCH, SISTERS' WAR
Imperial Swordsman! Why are you here?!

01:59.640 --> 02:01.020
(ALICE'S EXPLOSION)
Who are you?

02:01.020 --> 02:03.300
Ugh! You can tell if I do this!

02:03.300 --> 02:05.020
Ah! Rin?!

02:05.020 --> 02:06.940
What does this mean?

02:06.940 --> 02:09.230
T-That's... Err...

02:09.230 --> 02:13.150
My, my, you look awesome
with those glasses.

02:13.150 --> 02:14.970
It makes you look intelligent.

02:15.370 --> 02:16.570
No, wait... I mean...

02:16.940 --> 02:18.580
Are you on an imperial mission?

02:18.580 --> 02:21.290
If so, I can't just overlook it.

02:21.290 --> 02:24.290
N-No! You've got it all wrong!

02:24.290 --> 02:27.710
One melon soda and one strawberry
shake for one customer.

02:27.710 --> 02:28.670
Ah, okay.

02:29.020 --> 02:30.960
Please carry these with care.

02:30.960 --> 02:32.530
Thank you very much.

02:32.530 --> 02:34.580
This is not a mission.

02:34.580 --> 02:37.380
And it's not my intention either.

02:37.380 --> 02:39.770
So, um...

02:41.250 --> 02:43.040
Where did I get it wrong?

02:43.040 --> 02:45.310
Let's talk about this outside with us.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.450
Lady Alice.

02:47.580 --> 02:50.360
Thank you for coming.

02:50.360 --> 02:52.810
Kisasage! Warvick!

02:52.810 --> 02:54.950
Another guard for Sisbell, I assume?

02:54.950 --> 02:57.240
Lady Alice, who's that person?

02:57.240 --> 02:58.390
Umm... He is...

02:58.390 --> 03:00.350
Right! I was about to show him the way!

03:00.350 --> 03:04.000
He said he got lost,
and I was showing him the way out.

03:04.380 --> 03:06.330
Come on, you already know your way, right?

03:06.330 --> 03:07.690
O-Okay...

03:10.230 --> 03:13.790
I'll call a meeting at 9:00 p.m.,
so be ready to move.

03:14.250 --> 03:15.820
Understood.

03:16.260 --> 03:17.120
Rin.

03:17.120 --> 03:20.570
The Imperial Swordsman
headed toward the 8th exit.

03:20.570 --> 03:21.850
Here's your drink, Lady Alice.

03:21.850 --> 03:24.060
The number of juices is also important.

03:24.060 --> 03:26.870
That would mean that one
of his friends is also here.

03:26.870 --> 03:28.600
Maybe his friend from the Imperial Guard.

03:29.330 --> 03:32.100
Maybe that woman, Captain Mismis...

03:32.570 --> 03:34.150
It's quite possible.

03:34.990 --> 03:39.660
We can't let the Imperial Guard in,
even if it's Mismis.

03:40.610 --> 03:42.620
Lady Alice, I found him.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.860
That guy is just standing casually there...

03:46.370 --> 03:49.460
Something's odd.
Why is he not running away?

03:50.020 --> 03:52.380
Maybe he's waiting for someone.

03:58.930 --> 04:00.480
Sisbell?!

04:00.480 --> 04:03.680
Sorry to keep you waiting.
And thank you for the juice, too.

04:03.680 --> 04:05.860
Sisbell, we must hurry! Quick!

04:06.180 --> 04:10.150
Huh? What's the matter, Iska?
Why such a hurry?

04:10.150 --> 04:12.650
Wait for me, Iska!

04:12.650 --> 04:17.950
It looks like Lady Sisbell is connected
to the Imperial Army, which is a truth,

04:17.950 --> 04:19.660
but I'm still not sure.

04:20.010 --> 04:23.200
Sisbell... What in the world is going on?

04:26.800 --> 04:29.550
What is this frustration?

04:29.550 --> 04:32.460
I'm following them seriously, but...

04:32.460 --> 04:33.920
Lady Alice.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.650
He's giving that juice to Lady Sisbell.

04:36.570 --> 04:37.900
I know that.

04:38.670 --> 04:41.720
But still... She's getting along with him!

04:41.720 --> 04:42.870
Lady Alice!

04:42.870 --> 04:44.140
What is it now?

04:44.140 --> 04:47.100
Their shoulders are about to get closer!

04:47.100 --> 04:50.120
What the hell is that distance?!
They're too close!

04:50.120 --> 04:52.020
Her companion is an Imperial Soldier!

04:52.020 --> 04:54.320
Lady Alice! Watch that!

04:54.320 --> 04:57.300
Lady Sisbell is grabbing his hand!

04:57.740 --> 05:00.880
W-Wait a minute!
That would bother Iska!

05:00.880 --> 05:02.820
But that girl is still doing that...

05:15.290 --> 05:16.460
Lady Alice?

05:16.460 --> 05:20.370
Is something wrong, Lady Alice?!
Your face is all red!

05:20.370 --> 05:24.540
This is an important matter!
Iska belongs to me!

05:24.540 --> 05:25.840
But that girl...

05:26.310 --> 05:28.520
Look at that, Lady Alice!

05:36.400 --> 05:40.110
Why are they doing it in public?

05:40.110 --> 05:42.150
I'm so jealous...

05:42.150 --> 05:43.530
Wait, no!

05:43.530 --> 05:46.330
Iska must be surprised too!

05:46.330 --> 05:48.240
Lady Alice!

05:51.080 --> 05:54.960
No... Sisbell... You can't do that!

05:58.030 --> 06:00.260
This is a war.

06:00.260 --> 06:02.680
Uhh... Lady Alice?

06:02.680 --> 06:06.630
Rin. The Empire was not
the greatest enemy.

06:06.630 --> 06:08.060
Excuse me?

06:08.060 --> 06:10.640
I'm going to turn her
into an ice sculpture

06:10.640 --> 06:12.980
and sell her to a jewelry store right now.

06:12.980 --> 06:15.550
Don't do that!
Please, come to your senses!

06:15.550 --> 06:16.590
Let me go, Rin!

06:16.590 --> 06:18.030
I won't!

06:18.030 --> 06:21.440
I'm sure my mother will forgive me
for having a duel with that girl!

06:21.440 --> 06:24.260
No, you can't do that!

06:25.200 --> 06:28.750
Right. It wasn't a direct kiss on the lips.

06:28.750 --> 06:30.040
Just a bubble.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.000
What?

06:31.420 --> 06:35.490
Lady Alice, could you please
leave those two to me?

06:37.000 --> 06:41.270
Oh my, Lady Alice, what happened to you?

06:41.270 --> 06:44.720
This was supposed to end Sisbell's capture!

06:44.720 --> 06:49.220
Why do I have to calm
Lady Alice in this situation?

06:49.220 --> 06:50.470
Imperial Swordsman!

06:50.470 --> 06:51.060
Rin?!

06:51.540 --> 06:54.850
Please be quiet.
You too, Imperial Swordsman.

06:54.850 --> 06:57.270
We've been looking for you, Lady Sisbell.

06:57.710 --> 07:00.230
You look very unusual, Rin.

07:00.720 --> 07:04.820
The Lord Mask is looking for you
on a certain charge.

07:05.780 --> 07:10.700
We have been sent by Her Highness
the Queen to protect you.

07:11.140 --> 07:13.610
I do not seek protection.

07:13.610 --> 07:16.170
Please tell big sister Alice about that.

07:16.170 --> 07:18.330
Then, let me ask you one question.

07:18.330 --> 07:20.710
"Why is that guy here?"
Right?

07:21.500 --> 07:24.510
It has to do with our captain.

07:24.510 --> 07:25.970
Iska?

07:25.970 --> 07:27.980
We should clear up the misunderstanding.

07:27.980 --> 07:31.180
Keeping quiet here will only
make us suspect each other.

07:31.180 --> 07:32.860
I understand.

07:32.860 --> 07:34.670
Then let me tell her.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.690
Delicious.

07:44.240 --> 07:46.100
That monster...

07:46.100 --> 07:49.780
She appeared in front of me
for the first time in a long while

07:49.780 --> 07:52.370
and then gave me this information.

07:57.960 --> 08:00.250
Emperor Yunmelngen...

08:01.670 --> 08:04.090
What exactly is she thinking?

08:06.510 --> 08:07.530
We're back.

08:07.530 --> 08:08.760
Welcome back.

08:08.760 --> 08:10.730
What happened with her?

08:10.730 --> 08:13.230
She's tired of doing something
she's not used to.

08:13.640 --> 08:16.770
Jhin, can I ask you to watch her again?

08:16.770 --> 08:18.530
Just an hour.

08:18.530 --> 08:19.520
Sure.

08:20.000 --> 08:22.360
You came alone, as you promised.

08:22.360 --> 08:23.480
Well, yeah.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.280
What about Lady Sisbell?

08:25.280 --> 08:26.940
She's exhausted and has already slept.

08:26.940 --> 08:30.030
It's because someone must have been
asking her a lot of questions.

08:30.890 --> 08:34.580
This time, it's her own fault.

08:34.580 --> 08:37.340
If they knew that she asked
the Imperial Guard to escort her,

08:37.340 --> 08:39.370
they would be in an uproar.

08:39.370 --> 08:41.810
It's not something we wanted either.

08:41.810 --> 08:46.010
We'd rather get paid and leave
the Imperial Palace immediately.

08:46.010 --> 08:49.150
That's your problem between
you and Lady Sisbell.

08:49.150 --> 08:52.860
If this fact were to come to light,
it would be a big problem.

08:52.860 --> 08:54.510
If that happens,

08:54.510 --> 08:57.850
we will have no choice but to
"turn a blind eye" to Lady Sisbell's actions.

08:57.850 --> 09:00.140
Turn a blind eye, huh?

09:00.140 --> 09:04.420
I would not have believed this story
if Lady Sisbell's guards

09:04.420 --> 09:06.480
were Imperial soldiers other than you.

09:08.440 --> 09:09.450
But...

09:09.840 --> 09:13.160
Lady Alice wants to hear your testimony.

09:13.160 --> 09:13.780
What?!

09:13.780 --> 09:15.660
You are the only one who can enter.

09:15.660 --> 09:16.870
What about you?

09:16.870 --> 09:17.700
Ouch!

09:17.700 --> 09:19.580
Get the hell inside.

09:19.580 --> 09:21.820
You'll take your interrogation
or the torture!

09:21.820 --> 09:24.210
That's too dangerous!

09:24.210 --> 09:27.880
Lady Alice is really getting
annoyed at the moment.

09:27.880 --> 09:29.670
Huh? Why?

09:29.670 --> 09:30.590
I don't know.

09:30.590 --> 09:34.730
But what's important is that she needs
a human pillar to vent her anger.

09:34.730 --> 09:36.310
By the way, I don't want to do it.

09:36.310 --> 09:37.900
I don't want to do it either!

09:37.900 --> 09:39.350
Just go inside!

09:39.350 --> 09:42.960
H-Hey!

09:50.580 --> 09:53.440
U-Umm...

09:53.440 --> 09:55.640
Rin showed me the way.

09:55.640 --> 09:58.790
She told me that you want to hear
my testimony about Sisbell.

09:58.790 --> 09:59.680
I don't need that.

10:00.410 --> 10:01.070
Huh?

10:03.190 --> 10:05.250
I don't call you here because of that.

10:07.740 --> 10:10.370
I don't understand it...

10:11.300 --> 10:13.180
What is the meaning of this?!

10:13.570 --> 10:15.340
What's this all about?

10:15.340 --> 10:17.600
I have no idea what you're talking about.

10:19.340 --> 10:21.340
You were walking with her,
weren't you?

10:21.740 --> 10:22.900
With Sisbell?

10:24.250 --> 10:26.150
I saw it.

10:26.150 --> 10:27.480
Ah...

10:27.850 --> 10:32.280
It was part of the escort, and the two of us
were doing reconnaissance at the station.

10:32.640 --> 10:36.870
It's certainly not something that is
unacceptable to either country.

10:36.870 --> 10:38.700
Is that why you are angry?

10:39.760 --> 10:40.670
No...

10:41.760 --> 10:43.370
N-No...

10:43.750 --> 10:49.800
Alice, you may be offended,
but I don't understand unless you tell me.

10:51.420 --> 10:53.340
You were walking together with her...

10:53.770 --> 10:54.510
Huh?

10:54.510 --> 10:57.180
And you were holding hands with her...

10:57.180 --> 10:59.110
And you left me alone!

10:59.510 --> 11:01.770
Because I'm her guard.

11:01.770 --> 11:05.310
You...! You should at least
have some consideration!

11:05.310 --> 11:06.350
What?

11:06.730 --> 11:09.020
Fine. I'll tell you.

11:09.900 --> 11:11.900
You only think about Sisbell!

11:13.820 --> 11:14.700
Excuse me?

11:15.700 --> 11:17.230
This is a betrayal!

11:17.230 --> 11:18.620
What are you talking about?!

11:18.620 --> 11:22.950
You promised me that you would only be mine,
and now you're doing that to her!

11:22.950 --> 11:25.420
Our lives are at stake too!

11:25.420 --> 11:27.960
And I don't think it's betrayal!

11:27.960 --> 11:30.420
But I don't agree with it!

11:30.420 --> 11:34.040
Then, if I demand the seal from you
in exchange for not being Sisbell's bodyguard,

11:34.040 --> 11:36.740
will you give it to me?

11:37.420 --> 11:39.530
I-I can't do that.

11:39.530 --> 11:42.390
I can't show mercy to my enemy!

11:42.390 --> 11:44.270
Then we both have no choice, see?

11:46.230 --> 11:49.230
Even if you sound like that...

11:50.960 --> 11:54.150
You can't even notice
that I'm angry.

11:54.150 --> 11:57.890
It would be weird if I noticed that.
We're enemies after all.

11:57.890 --> 12:00.370
I've lost all interest in being selfish.

12:00.370 --> 12:03.900
I feel a little better
now that I see your face.

12:04.370 --> 12:06.140
Let me tell you something.

12:06.720 --> 12:09.730
You're not the one I'm mad at.

12:09.730 --> 12:10.920
Oh, really?

12:11.250 --> 12:13.380
So you're not mad at Sisbell, either?

12:13.380 --> 12:15.190
I'm mad at her!

12:15.190 --> 12:17.380
She is the one who makes me mad!

12:17.380 --> 12:20.670
Is she?!
What are you going to do?

12:20.670 --> 12:22.010
Good question.

12:22.390 --> 12:26.060
The reason I called you here is to testify.

12:26.060 --> 12:29.260
As the second princess
of the Nebulis Sovereignty,

12:29.260 --> 12:32.080
I have the authority to judge
the lower princesses.

12:32.730 --> 12:34.480
You have that authority?

12:34.480 --> 12:37.480
I'll make that law
when I get back to the castle.

12:37.480 --> 12:39.320
You're just wanting to judge her!

12:39.320 --> 12:42.380
It's a confirmation
of what Sisbell did to you.

12:42.380 --> 12:46.980
As your only rival,
I have a right to know.

12:47.430 --> 12:49.150
What are those glasses?

12:49.860 --> 12:51.880
It's a reenactment.

12:56.800 --> 12:58.260
A-Alice?

12:58.990 --> 13:01.330
You were holding hands
together with her, right?

13:01.890 --> 13:03.360
Like this.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.060
D-Don't move!

13:05.720 --> 13:09.260
So this is the kind of thing
she was doing with you.

13:09.260 --> 13:11.730
I think you can tell
just by looking at us.

13:11.730 --> 13:14.910
I have to actually experience it to know.

13:14.910 --> 13:19.840
And... Your palms are so tight.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.070
This is too weird!

13:21.070 --> 13:23.200
This is an investigation!

13:23.200 --> 13:25.490
This is so shameless.

13:26.450 --> 13:30.770
I can't believe a princess of a country
is walking arm in arm with an enemy soldier.

13:30.770 --> 13:33.250
But you just did the same thing...

13:33.250 --> 13:35.970
I'm just doing an inspection!

13:35.970 --> 13:38.860
I need to look more carefully
into the relationship

13:38.860 --> 13:41.370
between the imperial princess
and the imperial soldier.

13:41.370 --> 13:42.760
To look carefully?

13:42.760 --> 13:47.120
You're right.
She could have been closer to you.

13:47.120 --> 13:47.770
Hey!

13:47.770 --> 13:48.560
Eh?!

13:48.560 --> 13:50.350
L-Like this...

13:50.350 --> 13:51.600
Wait...!

13:51.600 --> 13:55.830
Alice... W-What are you doing?

13:55.830 --> 13:57.850
I'm just copying Sisbell!

13:59.210 --> 14:03.290
She's not fair...
I mean, she's so shameless...

14:03.290 --> 14:06.280
Then you should let go of my arm too!

14:06.280 --> 14:07.530
I can't do that!

14:14.460 --> 14:15.670
What are you doing?!

14:15.670 --> 14:17.820
I'm just nervous!

14:17.820 --> 14:21.210
This is what I feel when I'm getting closer
to my greatest enemy.

14:21.210 --> 14:22.970
Then you must take your hands off me!

14:22.970 --> 14:25.220
I don't want to let you go...

14:25.220 --> 14:26.010
Huh?

14:26.010 --> 14:28.510
I-I didn't say anything!

14:28.510 --> 14:31.810
What I said earlier...
Ah, right!

14:31.810 --> 14:34.960
I'm just trying to get a feel
for what Sisbell's going through!

14:49.990 --> 14:50.820
Ah...

14:51.370 --> 14:53.030
You see, Iska...

14:53.330 --> 14:56.830
Are you okay, Lady Alice?!

14:57.170 --> 15:00.510
I still think it's dangerous to be alone
with this Imperial Swordsman!

15:00.510 --> 15:03.460
Rin! We were just in the best part!

15:03.460 --> 15:04.490
What is that?

15:05.950 --> 15:06.910
Lady Alice?

15:06.910 --> 15:07.970
What is it?

15:08.410 --> 15:10.810
Your skin seems to be glowing, doesn't it?

15:10.810 --> 15:12.220
Is it?

15:12.890 --> 15:14.560
What happened to you?

15:14.560 --> 15:15.810
It's nothing!

15:16.270 --> 15:17.940
Your face looks red.

15:17.940 --> 15:20.620
It's just your imagination!

15:20.620 --> 15:22.300
Lady Alice, excuse me.

15:22.300 --> 15:25.050
Oh, no! It's a very high fever!

15:25.050 --> 15:26.810
You should rest now!

15:26.810 --> 15:29.330
No way! That's not true!

15:29.330 --> 15:30.620
- Imperial Swordsman!
- I'm fine...

15:30.620 --> 15:35.410
You're guilty of pretending to ignore
Lady Alice's fever!

15:35.410 --> 15:36.960
You've got it all wrong!

15:36.960 --> 15:39.210
Shut up! You've got two seconds
to get out of here!

15:39.210 --> 15:42.310
But you're the one who called me here!

15:47.720 --> 15:51.040
Alice's body heat still remains...

15:52.180 --> 15:55.830
Ah, geez! They really got it wrong!

15:57.850 --> 16:00.310
I am so happy.

16:00.970 --> 16:05.470
By hastily opening the council, we force
the Zoa family to remain in this castle,

16:05.470 --> 16:09.180
and in the meantime,
we ask Alice to protect Sisbell.

16:09.660 --> 16:13.810
You can call this the dauntless
abuse of noble birth.

16:14.890 --> 16:17.710
That's what a queen should be.

16:17.710 --> 16:21.380
Elletear, refrain from making
misleading statements.

16:21.380 --> 16:23.630
I beg your pardon.

16:23.630 --> 16:26.630
But it was a good way
to kill time, wasn't it?

16:26.630 --> 16:28.860
Your Majesty, it's time to go.

16:28.860 --> 16:30.160
Let's go.

16:37.020 --> 16:40.310
Goodbye, members of the Lou family.

16:43.020 --> 16:45.730
Don't underestimate me!
Destructive Winds!

16:49.280 --> 16:50.860
Are you guys okay?

16:50.860 --> 16:51.570
Yes.

16:51.570 --> 16:55.340
We are fine! We must stop
your bleeding, Your Majesty!

16:55.340 --> 16:57.250
Don't worry about it.

16:57.250 --> 16:59.790
It's red, but only on the surface.

16:59.790 --> 17:01.890
It was a close call.

17:02.460 --> 17:05.210
We were saved by the queen's power.

17:05.550 --> 17:06.540
Your Majesty!

17:06.540 --> 17:08.170
Lady Elletear!
What was that?!

17:08.170 --> 17:10.460
Someone must have attacked us.

17:10.460 --> 17:13.030
Did you see anyone
suspicious outside the door?

17:13.030 --> 17:13.740
No.

17:13.740 --> 17:15.780
There were no suspicious signs.

17:15.780 --> 17:16.930
Your Majesty.

17:16.930 --> 17:21.400
At the moment of the explosion,
I thought I heard a familiar voice.

17:21.400 --> 17:24.480
What a coincidence.
Me too.

17:24.480 --> 17:28.240
It sounded like the Lord Mask
of the Zoa family.

17:28.740 --> 17:31.050
I-I think I heard that too.

17:31.050 --> 17:32.570
Me too!

17:32.570 --> 17:34.930
The meeting is adjourned.

17:34.930 --> 17:36.370
Your Majesty,

17:36.720 --> 17:38.330
what is going on here?

17:38.330 --> 17:40.960
I came here to attend the meeting,
and this is what I found.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.990
As you can see, it was an attack.

17:42.990 --> 17:47.130
It was the work of someone with no conscience
who wanted to assassinate the queen.

17:47.130 --> 17:49.260
And who did it?

17:49.260 --> 17:51.550
It was you, Lord Mask.

17:51.980 --> 17:55.930
Did I mishear you?
I don't understand.

17:56.300 --> 17:58.690
Let's hear your story at the arraignment.

17:59.390 --> 18:02.350
I see. That was an interesting trick.

18:02.880 --> 18:07.070
- I will personally address the Zoa family...
- Please wait, Your Majesty.

18:07.510 --> 18:09.910
As the head of the Hydra family,
I was looking forward

18:09.910 --> 18:12.820
to our blood family meeting for a long time,

18:12.820 --> 18:15.450
but it seems something bad just happened.

18:15.450 --> 18:17.220
Lord Talisman.

18:18.120 --> 18:22.710
Nevertheless, Queen, you should
take care of yourself first.

18:24.190 --> 18:26.540
It would be a disaster if something
happened to you.

18:26.540 --> 18:28.110
Give her some aid.

18:28.110 --> 18:28.670
Yes!

18:28.670 --> 18:31.670
Then, how do you deal
with the Zoa family?

18:32.510 --> 18:34.550
I'll take care of it.

18:34.550 --> 18:35.680
You?

18:35.680 --> 18:40.300
If you are worried, you can have
the Lou family archivist attend the meeting.

18:40.300 --> 18:43.280
At the same time, let's proceed
with the search for the culprit.

18:43.280 --> 18:47.330
Such a major incident could involve not only
the Lord Mask but also outside parties

18:47.330 --> 18:51.580
but also outside parties such as
the Zoa family or the Imperial Army.

18:52.800 --> 18:54.650
I'm counting on you, Vichyssoise.

19:00.020 --> 19:03.120
At your service, Your Majesty.

19:03.890 --> 19:07.210
I agree with Lord Talisman's proposal.

19:07.210 --> 19:09.000
Elletear...

19:09.000 --> 19:13.180
After all, this is a plot
against Her Majesty the Queen.

19:13.180 --> 19:17.390
We must mobilize all the power
of the royal family to solve it.

19:18.910 --> 19:20.290
I understand.

19:20.290 --> 19:23.910
Lord Talisman and Vichyssoise,
please lend me your help.

19:23.910 --> 19:27.440
The Hydra and Lou families will do
everything to solve this problem.

19:27.440 --> 19:29.650
Understood.

19:32.260 --> 19:35.400
Is this really the work of the Lord Mask?

19:35.400 --> 19:38.970
I'm afraid we're going
to need Sisbell at this time.

19:38.970 --> 19:42.380
With her abilities,
we can identify the culprit.

19:42.740 --> 19:45.820
But I'm sure the enemy
will realize the same thing.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.790
The next target will be...

19:48.180 --> 19:51.780
You must hurry, Alice.
Bring back Sisbell.

19:52.880 --> 19:55.760
It is a great achievement, Risya.

19:55.760 --> 19:59.570
12 units challenged the border
checkpoints with the implementation

19:59.570 --> 20:02.650
of the artificial star crest that was
the result of Omen's research,

20:02.650 --> 20:05.330
and 10 of them succeeded in passing through.

20:05.330 --> 20:08.560
We were all very nervous about it.

20:08.560 --> 20:13.280
One of the units reached the central
province of the Imperial Palace.

20:13.280 --> 20:16.910
I'll tell you first:
I don't want a bonus.

20:16.910 --> 20:18.960
I just want a vacation.

20:18.960 --> 20:21.690
You must appeal directly
to His Majesty, the Emperor.

20:21.690 --> 20:24.700
You are not under our control.

20:24.700 --> 20:27.390
Well, I thought you would say so.

20:27.390 --> 20:30.210
So, were you able to enter the palace?

20:30.210 --> 20:31.940
No, we couldn't.

20:31.940 --> 20:36.070
But something interesting happened
at the Nebulis Palace.

20:36.070 --> 20:38.260
Oh? That's news to me.

20:38.840 --> 20:41.550
Nebulis VIII was attacked.

20:41.940 --> 20:45.600
Just to be sure, it was not
the Imperial Army, right?

20:45.600 --> 20:50.480
Some of the descendants of the first ancestors
are dissatisfied with the current queen.

20:50.480 --> 20:53.570
They would make such a big deal
because of dissatisfaction?

20:54.000 --> 20:56.660
I think it's about time you told me.

20:57.110 --> 21:00.610
There are those in the Imperial Palace
who are complicit with the Empire, right?

21:01.030 --> 21:04.870
To your credit, I will tell you one thing.

21:04.870 --> 21:08.000
There is someone who keeps in touch with us.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.300
It's...

21:09.820 --> 21:12.880
The Purebred, Subject E.

21:14.420 --> 21:17.540
I hear they're in uproar right now.

21:17.540 --> 21:23.470
Well, even if the attempt to attack the queen
is unsuccessful, it will be a big fuss.

21:23.870 --> 21:26.810
Therefore, this is a perfect opportunity.

21:27.540 --> 21:30.660
Yo Risya, are you still alive?

21:31.730 --> 21:34.060
Welcome, Saint Disciples.

21:34.060 --> 21:37.100
We call upon you to join the fight.

21:37.100 --> 21:40.820
Our mission is to capture
the queen and the Purebred.

21:40.820 --> 21:42.640
Very well!

21:42.640 --> 21:46.240
I was eager to see it on this day!

21:46.240 --> 21:48.390
Be silent.

21:48.390 --> 21:50.910
Your voice disturbs the order.

21:50.910 --> 21:52.090
It's spectacular.

21:52.090 --> 21:55.210
I've never seen so many
Saint Disciples in one place before.

21:55.210 --> 21:58.670
Above heaven, below heaven.
I can handle it on my own.

21:58.670 --> 22:01.930
This is a very expensive plan.

22:01.930 --> 22:04.140
Oh, come on, everyone.

22:10.860 --> 22:16.780
Is it really okay for the direct subordinate
of His Majesty the Emperor to be here?

22:16.780 --> 22:21.440
We asked His Majesty
to bring him here, especially.

22:22.940 --> 22:26.530
To you, all highest-ranking warriors,

22:26.530 --> 22:29.190
you may wield your power
to your heart's content.
